---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
const posts=await getCollection('projects', ({data})=>!data.draft);
---
<Site title="Projects"><section class="page-opening"><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/28643185.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Sound engineer operating an outdoor mixing console" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><p class="eyebrow">Projects</p><h1>Skills into practice.</h1><p>A view of the training model and where we want to go next—not a portfolio of completed impact claims.</p><div class="row"><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/11410604.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Production crew preparing equipment backstage" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><p class="eyebrow">Cohort One — the Faithfire story</p><h2><a href="/faithfire/">Faithfire</a></h2><p>The first cohort wasn't a class. It was a crew. Faithfire Production is where PictureThis got its start: a church production team at 139 Millwick Dr that grew into a full production department, one show at a time. Most of the crew started with little to no experience. They learned the way this program teaches today: by shadowing someone more experienced, helping out on real shows, and then running their own positions.</p></div><div class="numbered"><div><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/8412361.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Two camera operators working beside production cameras" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><h2>The cohort capstone</h2><p>Part of the eight-week course. Participants crew a real production with mentor oversight, putting sound, camera, lighting and comms skills into practice. Event details are confirmed with the cohort.</p></div><div><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/8412361.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Two camera operators working beside production cameras" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><h2>Community access pathway</h2><p>Proposed expansion. Work with youth-serving organisations to understand barriers to joining, agree safe referral routes and connect training with specialist support. Partners and delivery arrangements are not yet confirmed.</p></div>{posts.map(post=><div><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/8412361.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Two camera operators working beside production cameras" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><h2><a href={"/projects/"+post.id+"/"}>{post.data.title}</a></h2><p>{post.data.summary}</p></div>)}</div><figure><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/34623187.jpeg?h=650&w=940" alt="Engineer working at an illuminated control desk"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure></section></Site>
